# Lesson 6.1 example: a small workflow protected by a test

# Load a known packet so the branch behavior is repeatable.
Load docs/course/06-testing-and-debugging/examples/01_branch_packet.txt as Document

Find review status and save as review_status

# This branch is the behavior the matching check file verifies.
If review_status is "approved"
  Route invoice to approved_queue
Otherwise
  Route invoice to manual_review_queue
